    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Our team had the opportunity to represent CIME at the 29th SESAM conference in Prague, held from June 19th to 21st. SESAM, the Society for Simulation in Europe, is dedicated to advancing healthcare simulation, and this year's conference brought together experts from around the world to exchange knowledge and best practices.",
